#: of pwnlib.testexample:7
msgid ""
"The tests for this module are run when the documentation is "
"automatically-generated by Sphinx.  This particular module is invoked by "
"an \"automodule\" directive, which imports everything in the module, or "
"everything listed in ``__all__`` in the module."
